# UI isolate

Native IPTV / catalog / EPG lists are large. Do not copy a huge
`List<MediaItem>` or packed EPG onto the UI isolate in one shot.

- Parse and ingest off-isolate (`Isolate.run`, chunked handoff).
- Prefer SQLite + paged reads for browse/search.
- Use helpers in `lib/compat/ui_isolate.dart` / `javp_compute.dart`.
- See `docs/architecture.md` → Catalog storage / UI isolate.
